<title>FRANCE: Suez Lyonnaise has pay-out aim of 40 to 50 pct.</title>
<headline>Suez Lyonnaise has pay-out aim of 40 to 50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux aims to pay out 40 to 50 percent of its earnings in dividends, Lyonnaise des Eaux and Cie de Suez said in a joint statement announcing a merger plan.</p>
</text>
